{"unit_id":"fuyao606__dsh-plugin-manager#card-zh","repo":"fuyao606/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"175102f8037a4d796a91cc48a93c36d6807c9b38","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-manager 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的本机插件管理器，在设置页提供插件清单和管理界面。它通过 Host 的 /plugin-manager/api 接口读取 web profile 中的依赖、bundle 挂载状态和已安装版本，并提供启用、禁用、安装及卸载操作；还会显示内置模块、普通依赖与冲突状态。安装或移除插件时会同步 bundle 清单，变更需要重启 dsh web 并刷新浏览器后生效。适合希望直接从 DSH 设置页面维护 Web profile 插件的用户；需要 Node.js 20 或更高版本以及本机 DSH 的 web profile。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:312-339","lib/index.js:341-425","lib/client.js:335-342"]}
{"unit_id":"fuyao606__dsh-plugin-manager#card-en","repo":"fuyao606/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"175102f8037a4d796a91cc48a93c36d6807c9b38","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-manager adds a plugin panel to DSH Web Settings. It lists installed plugins, versions, bundle states, and conflicts, and supports enabling, disabling, installing, and removing plugins. Changes update the local profile and require a dsh web restart. Requires Node.js 20+.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:312-339","lib/index.js:341-425","lib/client.js:335-342"]}
